WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Welcome to the CAI Design System

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A vanilla-first design system for precise, technical interfaces

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Built with semantic HTML and accessible by default

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
No runtime dependencies, no framework overhead

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Fully keyboard accessible with complete ARIA support

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Three built-in themes: light, dark, and high-contrast

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Ready for production use in v1.2.0 and beyond
